[statement]
A package the walk is walking leads nowhere through the names it
provides when a placement reaches it through its condition: walking `b`,
whose condition is `e`, places its dependency `e`, which reaches `b`;
`b` provides `w`, which `d` provides too, but `d` is not walked there,
and goes after `b`, where the request reaches it.

[repository]
P:b
V:2
D:so:x
p:w
i:e

P:e
V:1
p:so:x=2

P:d
V:3
p:w

[request]
b
d

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install e 1
install b 2
install d 3
